            "review_title": "Review at Vegan Home",
            "review_text": "Your Hanoi guide\nHanoi, Vietnam40 contributions\n0\nThe best vegan buffet in town\nNov 2019\nThis's a great vegan buffet restaurant which I eat there at least 3-4 times a week bcz they have:\n_ Perfect location if you are living, working or would love to hang around Hoan Kiem area because it's just a few minutes away from Hoan Kiem lake and the French church. Though the restaurant is on the 2nd & 3rd floor of a community house, they have a noticeable signboard to be recognized.\n_ Great restaurant owners: A wonderful family runs the business together & try to give you the best service - they cook fresh food with love and their health knowledge ( They have a plan-based diet and 2/3 of them are yoga teachers.), they use Eco-friendly package products, they always bring you something new and different on the table every day, everything is clean and tidy. It's also so great when they have member cards which you can exchange to a free meal when you get enough the stamps. \n_ Home-cooked food tastes so real and close. It's like eating a meal at home. The menu changes slightly every day. One of the things makes the restaurant special is they have different kind of noodles to serve each day, not only Phở. The sweet dessert isn't too sweet and besides free tea, you can order healthy shiro juice with just 20.000 vnd.\nThe buffet price is 75.000 vnd. ( notice that it's including a free parking ticket too.) \nIf you take away, it's 50.000 vnd or 60.000 vnd (if you take a soup.) On the 1st and 15th day of the month in Lunar calendar, they open for dinner too.\nIn sum, I love Vegan home and I hope they can keep doing their good work and staying on my list of top 3 vegan buffet restaurants in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 18, 2019",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
